{
 "encounter_id": "00977",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE",
  "person_4": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Dr Mehta, Mrs Iyer's obs are done. Blood pressure 138 over 84, pulse 76, weight 64 kilos. Her companion is with her."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, nurse. Mrs Iyer, welcome. What brings you in today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning, doctor. I am here for my diabetes screening. I read in the newspaper that every person above sixty should be screened, and I did not want to miss it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A very sensible reason. This is Shanti, your companion? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "Yes, doctor, I stay with her five days a week. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mrs Iyer, any symptoms that made you think of diabetes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I am thirsty more than before. I carry a bottle with me everywhere now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I get tired by the afternoon, but I am sixty-eight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you lost any weight without trying?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. My weight is the same as last year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medicines do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 5 mg, in the morning. Atorvastatin, 20 mg, at night. And aspirin, 75 mg, after breakfast."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Perhaps. After an injection at the hospital, I came out in a rash, but I do not know what the injection was."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "She was very itchy that night, I remember she told me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll record a possible allergy, unconfirmed. Any medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, for many years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cataract surgery in my left eye, in 2020."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What did you do before retiring?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I was a schoolteacher, thirty-two years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nurse, did you check her feet? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Yes, doctor, I looked. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me see them. Take off your shoes, Mrs Iyer.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There are no sores or cracks on either foot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the pulses at both ankles are present."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "She looks after her feet very well. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mrs Iyer, nothing in what I find today suggests diabetes. I think you're not showing signs of diabetes at the moment."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That is a relief. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "But a blood test is the only way to be sure, so I'd like to arrange an HbA1c blood test."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Today, the nurse will take it before you go. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll do it now. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep drinking water, and walk a little every day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "We walk to the park. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in a week to go through the result."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A week. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
